"┌help: msa fill────────────────────────────────────────────┐"
"│ msa fill [rows] [--cols COLS] --with CHAR                │"
"│                                                          │"
"│ Overwrite a block with one character, such as - or N.    │"
"│                                                          │"
"│ - Rows are numbered from 1, e.g. --rows 3-7,12; or       │"
"│   chosen with --name NAME (exact; repeatable) or --match │"
"│   REGEX (searched for in names).                         │"
"│ - Columns are numbered from 1, e.g. --cols 100-250.      │"
"└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
